    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d713">

                <pb facs="0705" n="1439" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1439"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Terrell.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-02"><hi rendition="#italic">January 2,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 751.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have received your Nos. 700 and 703, both
                    of the 3d ultimo, reporting Turkish charges of sedition against American
                    missionaries at Bitlis.</p>
                <p>The Department recognizes the wisdom of your suggestions and approves your course
                    in denouncing the charges as false.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Richard Olney.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
